---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import ProfilePicture from '../assets/profile-picture.jpeg'
---

<div>
  <hr />
  <h2 class="dark:text-gray-100">About the author</h2>
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-5 md:gap-8 mt-5">
    <div class="relative shrink-0 h-32 w-32">
      <Image
        class="not-prose h-32 w-32 object-cover rounded-full"
        width={128}
        height={128}
        src={ProfilePicture}
        loading="eager"
        alt="Maxence Poutord"
      />
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="mt-0! pb-2">
        Hey, I'm Maxence Poutord, a senior software engineer at Orderfox. I'm
        also an indie hacker behind
        <a href="https://pedalyze.bike">Pedalyze</a> and
        <a href="https://youtube-mate.com">YoutubeMate</a>. When I'm not
        shipping, you can find me cooking, cycling or running. I'm also on
        <a href="https://twitter.com/_maxpou">Twitter</a>,
        <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/maxpou.fr">Bluesky</a>,
        <a href="https://github.com/maxpou">GitHub</a>, and
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/maxpou">LinkedIn</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
